{#- THE HIDDEN ARCADE'S CONTROL ROOM (Chase, 2026-10-06: "an arcade editor
   for the admins. It can turn on and off games on the live site (turns it to
   out of order) and can manage the high scores and delete/??? names").

   Saves at once and applies at once (/api/admin/arcade) — like Forms, it is
   not part of the site's files, so it does not wait for Publish. The arcade
   itself being on or off is a page switch, in Settings. -#}
<div class="ae" id="aeRoot">
  <p class="rolegate" id="aeProblem" hidden></p>

  <section class="s-group v-group">
    <h3 data-i18n="ae.games">Games</h3>
    <div class="v-head">
      <div class="v-label"></div>
      {#- The same columns, in the same order, as Settings: the team's dev site, then visitors. -#}
      <span class="v-cell is-dev"><b data-i18n="vis.devCol">Only your team</b>
        <a class="v-open" href="https://dev.thauma.one/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dev.thauma.one ↗</a></span>
      <span class="v-cell is-live"><b data-i18n="vis.liveCol">Visitors</b>
        <a class="v-open" href="https://thauma.one/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">thauma.one ↗</a></span>
    </div>
    <div id="aeGames"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="s-group">
    <h3 data-i18n="ae.scores">High scores</h3>
    <div class="ae-boards" id="aeBoards"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="s-group">
    <h3 data-i18n="ae.blocked">Blocked names</h3>
    <div class="ae-blocked" id="aeBlocked"></div>
    <form class="ae-block" id="aeBlockForm">
      <input type="text" id="aeBlockName" maxlength="3" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"
             data-i18n-attr="aria-label:ae.blockName" aria-label="Name to block" placeholder="ABC">
      <button type="submit" class="ghost-btn sm" data-i18n="ae.block">Block</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>
